    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fireworks only to be used on Guy Fawkes night with a 10pm curfew to protect dogs",
        "additional_details": "We believe that reducing the nights they can be used will have a positive impact on animals\u2019 lives and the environment. Also only licensed people and organisations should be able to purchase them.",
        "background": "We want to reduce the number of nights fireworks can be used to protect animals from the trauma it causes them and their owners. They should be used on Guy Fawkes' night only with a 10pm curfew.",
